}

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Breaking: sets of pieces the game already ships (kit-bash). Every piece
-- is a one-bone physics part modelled in the reference model's space; a
-- rig maps the set into the breaking object's own box (zgo_props_models).
------------------------------------------------------------------------
